2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mover><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>×</mo></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The value <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"10\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> does <em>not</em> satisfy the original equation, so we discard it.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Second, we check whether the obtained value <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"11\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a solution of the original equation:</li>\n</ul>\n<p>